portunity and the means to correct any defect identified by such department pursuant to this subparagraph prior to transmission of such ballot.\\par\n(3)\\ulnone  [Such] \\ul The\\ulnone  department \\ul of correction\\ulnone  shall provide assistance to any [such] incarcerated individual in filling out [such] \\ul an early mail or absentee ballot\\ulnone  application\\ul ,\\ulnone  or \\ul an early mail or absentee\\ulnone  ballot\\ul ,\\ulnone  upon request. Such department shall, not later than [five] \\ul 5\\ulnone  days after receipt, transmit such completed applications and ballots from any incarcerated individual who wishes to have them transmitted to the board of elections for the city of New York.\\par\n\\ul b.\\ulnone  The provisions of this subdivision shall not apply in any specific instance in which the department deems it unsafe to comply therewith.\\par\n\\'a7 2. This local law takes effect 120 days after it becomes law.\\ul\\par\n\\pard\\ltrpar\\qj\\ulnone\\fs18\\par\nJMF\\par\nLS #22555\\par\n\\pard\\ltrpar 10/14/2026 7:59 PM\\par\n}\n",
